{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>התהללו</b> — The meaning: for there is no tongue by which the revered Name is called, except corresponding to His deeds, apart from Israel. Therefore התהללו; also let the heart of those who seek this Name rejoice, though they have not known Him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 105, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:19.933515394Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}